- **WESL Documentation**: Check `../wesl-js/` for WESL language features
- **WGSL Spec**: https://www.w3.org/TR/WGSL/
- **Existing Examples**: Review `math/`, `geometry/`, `color/` for patterns
- **Test Utilities**: See `test/wesl/testUtil.ts` for helper functions

